# The commit whose sources the X11 build must reproduce byte for byte.
#
# Everything the library compiles with the river flag *off* — src/ and the
# cabal file's shared stanza — is checked against this tree by
# tests/check-x11-source.sh.  The river backend is not allowed to perturb the
# X11 build, and a fork whose whole purpose is to track upstream cannot afford
# to find that out by bisecting later.
#
# Changing the X11 build is not forbidden, only unreviewable-by-accident.  When
# you do mean to change it, update this SHA in the same commit; the diff of
# this file is the signal that the X11 build moved on purpose.
fa3926efabf5dfe39de553a4d89a43296ed7c996
